#. i18n: file: part/dialogs/KWStartupWidget.ui:21
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, mainText)
#: rc.cpp:32
msgid ""
"<p><b>Check this option to have a text area created automatically for each "
"page.</b><br>\n"
"For letters and notes with one main text, possibly on several pages, you "
"should keep this checked. You should only uncheck it if you want to define "
"completely where each text frame should be positioned.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Clitchîz cisse tchuze pos awè ene redjon di tecse ahivêye otomaticmint "
"po tchaeke pådje.</b><br>\n"
"Po les letes et les notes avou on mwaisse tecse, motoit so sacwantès pådjes, "
"vos dvrîz wårder çoula clitchî. Vos nel divrîz disclitchî ki si vs voloz pår "
"defini ewou tchaeke cåde di tecse doet esse plaecî.</p>"

